{
  "title": "Oven Toasted Middle Eastern Katsuobushi Pilaf",
  "description": "A nutty and crunchy one-pot Middle Eastern dish featuring katsuobushi, this pescatarian-friendly pilaf is cooked to perfection in a copper mug.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
